# Never run destructive `git clean` in sevn.bot

**FORBIDDEN** (deletes gitignored local-only operator docs):

```bash
git clean -fdx
git clean -fdX
git clean -x
git clean -X
```

Destroys `plan/`, `specs/`, `prd/`, `examples/`, `prompts/`, and other `.gitignore` trees. Confirmed data loss: 2026-06-17 (CI wave-runner ran `git clean -fdx` on main checkout).

**Allowed:**

```bash
git clean -fd
git clean -fd -- path/to/dir
```

**Never** combine `git reset --hard` with any `git clean` to "clean WIP" without backing up `plan/`, `specs/`, `prd/` outside the repo.

`make setup` / `make install-git-guards` installs a repo-local `alias.clean` in `.git/config` that **blocks** `-x`/`-X`. If `git clean -fdx` is not blocked, run `make install-git-guards` before doing anything else.
